    {
      "id": "145c9ed3-bde7-46e0-992e-37d872afc19f",
      "title": "Olhe a imagem, escute o áudio e observe a escrita em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "b64f7517-e3b2-4132-a2bb-070af1cf4d02",
          "textContent": "<p>Olhe, escute e leia.</p><p><strong>café</strong></p><p>Em português: café.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/49bf7c4655904598bd83c0af287a163f_b01-contexto-cafe.png?Expires=1794099472&Signature=G3iYCdq4m6EwY2WPGH0CYWqpVq2cW7UsWdj~qWyXh9vpHjXtwTGC19hpmDZxRaBKwtDIaQKu-aOiXnxlOx-zn6lYMbeGdCDzmn7iraK-mxriuFJEhMi0JhhfX8XMXJPGZLdj7oL9LrVayv~WJZrChCl~4SUk0RRFsPmsFi1IE-aJUsFNhMVwFmdCULjw1OpxiXp2gdGQjdzjmvSk3uHwp4nz43B29kw-d5chILSnDXUoBavev8W1Rdy4~f2VaVVOC4Qn8O94dBxsYPOWyYKHg9VAdsuxx3DsdVnj9UjGV-q~3XSpBFHOq8Hz~Q9-gdUofIiCQ0IyqvRNqrBGdIJIvA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/19ebccc4e21e46058ba0097f0811026b_b02-cafe.mp3?Expires=1794099472&Signature=eRVg4MR6drNDofjBzXSyCO7yMQEMS3Fzktf5cmRdWnqy6T6rj0OPt-I2Mdrby1iArmR4e9LpwBM-0Lft~yxhAIoqlEGaOUfppHdCzPEKrY3-NcaKmcw5AeJo44S1UwKz~kK6LVUNDH1QhpboNuXdreYd6MfmYH83wco9E-2Y4PO47X9h-nKhFD3ijEl8kEVtDGpfzFslCIsRiIFqqKe6ole9JFnDu8RET~pNEfSrBdX8LSWA6FnYts8IvcyBi~eLzuulTOTzD5ea2seAapB-mufD4t6~gDeS-Ydr-WPd2fsMajaYok16Lu8pwRLNZ9T2mdUUtQmh6on5dJfjmBxttg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
